error[reserved-name] 3:6-3:13
  (def attempt 1)
       ^^^^^^^
  attempt is the name of a form, so it cannot name a value.
  Fix: attempts
  Help: sx help attempt

error[reserved-name] 4:7-4:11
  (defn loop [x] x)
        ^^^^
  loop is the name of a form, so it cannot name a value.
  Fix: loops
  Help: sx help loop
